 ## Releasing
 
 Push a `v*` tag; the `release` workflow runs GoReleaser (`.goreleaser.yaml`) and publishes the archives to the GitHub
-release. Local dry run: `goreleaser release --snapshot --clean`.
+release (macOS arm64 and linux amd64 only), then updates the cask in
+[acme-retail/homebrew-tap](https://github.com/acme-retail/homebrew-tap). The tap push needs the
+`HOMEBREW_TAP_GITHUB_TOKEN` repository secret (fine-grained token, contents: write on the tap).
+Local dry run: `goreleaser release --snapshot --clean`.
+
+Install: `brew install acme-retail/tap/inventory-cli`.
